# 5.3 the cable is pulled in a desk session: after the 6 s debounce a clean ordered stop (no budget), the intent
# stays on, the chain waits for the headset; on replug (4 s steady) the session is restored.
start desk
at 10 down usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 15 runs 0
expect 17 ran stop-subtree monado
expect 40 intent on
expect 40 health monado blocked
expect 40 notified resumes when it is back
expect 60 notified Headset not connected for 30 s
at 120 up usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 123 runs 1
expect 125 ran start monado
expect 150 overall ok
expect 150 runs 2
